1
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:43,020
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:48,200
Lord Xie, save me!

4
00:01:56,509 --> 00:01:58,280
Bloodshed in a mourning hall

5
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,430
is a grave taboo.

6
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:02,470
But I've got a case to handle,

7
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:04,560
so I can't concern myself with that.

8
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:07,820
My family's case was merely
an old miscarriage of justice.

9
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,240
Yet how many wrongful, tragic cases

10
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,260
has Hengtang seen over the years?

11
00:02:12,850 --> 00:02:15,050
My family's case is hardly the only one.

12
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,870
My purpose in coming this time

13
00:02:22,450 --> 00:02:25,120
is to bring Hengtang to order,
once and for all.

14
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,540
As for these guilty lives,

15
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,520
consider them

16
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:31,750
extra lamps lit along the road
to the underworld

17
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:33,880
to guide our loyal and righteous dead.

18
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,000
I just don't know if they will be enough.

19
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:50,070
My good nephew,

20
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,960
you've done well.

21
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,420
You've upheld the will of Heaven.

22
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:57,240
If Zhenglun could
know of this from beyond the grave,

23
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,120
he would find peace with the past.

24
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,750
Lord Xie,

25
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,530
your eldest son

26
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,680
gave his life

27
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:10,450
to help you rise in rank
and become an earl.

28
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:13,120
And with just that offhand remark,

29
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:17,450
you've decided that, for him,
all those past grievances are settled.

30
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,170
Whether alive or dead,

31
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:22,430
he is my son.

32
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,430
And he will always obey me.

33
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,120
Lord Shen!

34
00:03:30,070 --> 00:03:30,840
Lord Shen,

35
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,000
my brother was murdered!

36
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:34,800
He was murdered by this poisonous woman!

37
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,560
Zhengjun,

38
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,400
stop making a scene here.

39
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,150
I'm not!

40
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,360
Shut up!

41
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,380
Haven't you made enough of a scene today?

42
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,240
Lord Xie,

43
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:03,360
does seeing me,
the son of your old friend,

44
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,630
bring you any gratification?

45
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:09,400
Gratified indeed.

46
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:12,700
My old friend's name is cleared at last,

47
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,560
my long-held wish fulfilled.

48
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:17,720
And now, I've received

49
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:20,370
even greater favor from His Majesty.

50
00:04:22,870 --> 00:04:24,680
I feel truly gratified.

51
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:50,270
As for everyone present here today—

52
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,740
the dead, drag them out and bury them;

53
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,800
the living,

54
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,330
take them all away!

55
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:07,390
Cut the crap! Move!

56
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:24,970
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

57
00:05:25,030 --> 00:05:31,100
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

58
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,430
It's been a while.

59
00:05:31,170 --> 00:05:36,460
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

60
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:42,570
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

61
00:05:42,650 --> 00:05:48,840
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

62
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:55,130
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

63
00:05:55,220 --> 00:06:01,510
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

64
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:07,170
[Commandant of Loyalty and Power
Xie Zhenglun]

65
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:07,440
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

66
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:13,630
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

67
00:06:13,650 --> 00:06:19,750
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

68
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:20,730
[Mengliang]

69
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:25,990
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

70
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:27,110
[Commandant of Loyalty and Power
Xie Zhenglun]

71
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:31,950
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

72
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:53,360
Eldest Brother,

73
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,830
I wonder if you find

74
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,630
today's farce ridiculous.

75
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,190
Please watch patiently from above.

76
00:07:00,470 --> 00:07:06,300
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

77
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:05,280
[Mengliang]

78
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,310
This show

79
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:08,000
I've put on for you is far from over.

80
00:07:06,330 --> 00:07:12,230
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

81
00:07:12,470 --> 00:07:17,820
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

82
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:23,310
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

83
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,360
Help!

84
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,630
Murder!

85
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,870
Insolent!

86
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:44,920
Get lost!

87
00:07:45,790 --> 00:07:47,850
You dare attempt to...

88
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,600
attempt to kill me, the Head Madam?

89
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,860
You'll be struck down by heaven for this!

90
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,780
You caused my brother's death

91
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,480
and drove my mother mad.

92
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,520
I'll never let you off today.

93
00:08:03,010 --> 00:08:04,230
I must kill you!

94
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Run, then!

95
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:19,630
Let's see how far you get.

96
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,680
Let's see where you can possibly go.

97
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,789
Rebellious son,

98
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,270
how dare you

99
00:08:39,270 --> 00:08:41,000
attempt to kill the Head Madam!

100
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,750
Father!

101
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,540
He wasn't just my brother!

102
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:46,030
He was your son too!

103
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,390
Father.

104
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,370
I don't need you to remind me,

105
00:08:51,370 --> 00:08:53,630
and I certainly don't need you
to make decisions for me!

106
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,910
But how can I stand by
while this poisonous woman is right here?

107
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,480
Then I'll confine you for 10 days!

108
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,910
Let's see just how wild you really are!

109
00:08:58,910 --> 00:08:59,620
Servants!

110
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:00,930
No need!

111
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:07,880
I'll go to the estate
in the suburbs myself

112
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,490
to be with my mother.

113
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,870
Father,

114
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:46,500
you can't blame Second Brother for this.

115
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:50,670
Eldest Brother was appointed as
the Commandant of Loyalty and Power by His Majesty.

116
00:09:50,670 --> 00:09:51,960
If the culprit isn't severely punished,

117
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,200
how can Eldest Brother's heroic soul

118
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,430
rest in peace?

119
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:55,870
And what would the people of Hengtang

120
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:57,240
think of our family?

121
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:59,270
Say no more.

122
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,510
Wenzhuo,

123
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,040
it seems I have no choice but to place you

124
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:10,560
under house arrest in Wuzhu Courtyard.

125
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,670
Tonight...

126
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,720
I was almost killed.

127
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,670
And instead of punishing them,

128
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:20,000
you're confining me?

129
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,080
Wenzhuo...

130
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,750
Zhenglun

131
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:30,200
was the most promising eldest son
of our family.

132
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:31,840
Yet you...

133
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,510
You've...

134
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,380
destroyed the foundation of the family.

135
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,390
It's only out of regard for

136
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,010
your position as Head Madam

137
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:43,080
that I...

138
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,960
This is already a light punishment.

139
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,180
You should take this opportunity

140
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,730
to stay out of the fray for a while.

141
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:56,250
Who is the most promising child
of the family?

142
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,870
Zhenglun?

143
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,910
Surely you haven't forgotten

144
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,030
the fully formed baby boy

145
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,750
who died in my womb.

146
00:11:11,330 --> 00:11:13,460
He was the true eldest legitimate son.

147
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:15,910
He was the most promising child.

148
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:23,120
Wenzhuo.

149
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:27,280
If you hadn't deliberately
made me miscarry,

150
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,930
by now

151
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:31,960
he'd be old enough to serve the country,

152
00:11:32,030 --> 00:11:33,500
fight on the battlefield,

153
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,260
and bring honor to the family!

154
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:38,630
But now,

155
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:42,890
every night, I hear him crying.

156
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,440
He often cries out,

157
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,270
"Mother,

158
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,840
save me.

159
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:51,670
Mother,

160
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,000
save me.

161
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,720
Mother,

162
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,840
save me!"

163
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,900
What nonsense are you talking about?

164
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,490
Your miscarriage that day

165
00:12:03,670 --> 00:12:05,180
was purely an accident.

166
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,750
The physician made it very clear.

167
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,440
Only you

168
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,530
became obsessed with it

169
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,480
and refused to believe it.

170
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:17,080
Mother,

171
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,750
karma

172
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:21,910
has been served.

173
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,630
Accident or not...

174
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,340
don't you know perfectly well yourself?

175
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,750
Let karma have its way.

176
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:40,080
Let it.

177
00:12:49,650 --> 00:12:50,870
Qingyuan.

178
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:56,440
Don't you want to
seek justice for your mother?

179
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,390
Seek it properly.

180
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,890
This is how things have always been

181
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,770
in this family's inner household.

182
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,250
One grievance answered with another.

183
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,550
But the root of it all

184
00:13:12,150 --> 00:13:14,150
is that you have a good father.

185
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,600
He's

186
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,910
the most heartless

187
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,620
and venomous man in the world.

188
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:25,480
You blame me for Zhenglun's death?

189
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,620
Why don't you ask your father?

190
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,810
Isn't Zhenglun's death

191
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,750
exactly what you wanted?

192
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,870
If Zhenglun hadn't died,

193
00:13:42,870 --> 00:13:45,270
you wouldn't have
your title of earl today.

194
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:47,440
Wenzhuo!

195
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,880
You've gone too far!

196
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:53,270
I ask you to show some restraint.

197
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:54,390
Mind your standing

198
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:57,720
in front of the younger generation.

199
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,030
My standing?

200
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,200
I'm not Mei Yinghua.

201
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:10,480
Didn't you climb to your present position,

202
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:13,960
step by step,

203
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,830
on the strength of my status?

204
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:20,440
Save some face for yourself.

205
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,960
Since we've come this far,

206
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:30,630
let's have it out properly.

207
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,790
Before the funeral,

208
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:35,510
I'd already written to my brother.

209
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:37,630
It shouldn't be long

210
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:40,030
before he arrives in Hengtang.

211
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,440
When he does,

212
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,850
I'll let him have a proper talk with you

213
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:47,310
about what my standing really is

214
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,270
and whether I had

215
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,850
anything to do with Zhenglun's death.

216
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,440
How arrogant of you.

217
00:14:58,270 --> 00:15:01,120
You think that simply because
you have a powerful brother,

218
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:04,500
you can murder
our Xie family's flesh and blood

219
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,080
and get away with it?

220
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:10,360
Take it.

221
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:11,480
Show it to her.

222
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:27,150
Our elder brother

223
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:28,810
is busy with official duties.

224
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,360
I'm afraid he won't be coming here soon.

225
00:15:31,690 --> 00:15:33,490
[To repay Your Majesty's trust, the Xie clan
vows to serve you for generations,]

226
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:35,180
[safeguarding Jiangnan's
wealth and revenues unto death.]

227
00:15:35,290 --> 00:15:42,150
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

228
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:44,120
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

229
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,630
Nanny Liu.

230
00:15:56,270 --> 00:15:57,130
Yes, Old Madam.

231
00:15:57,750 --> 00:15:59,480
You have done all kinds of evil.

232
00:15:59,630 --> 00:16:01,480
You shall be punished
according to the family rules.

233
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,360
Servants,

234
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:03,870
drag her out

235
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:05,530
and give her 20 strokes.

236
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:06,440
Old Madam.

237
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,960
I'm innocent, Old Madam!

238
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:10,200
Whether she lives or dies
depends on her own fate!

239
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,510
Old Madam, please spare me!

240
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,390
Old Madam!

241
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:13,870
Old Madam!

242
00:16:16,670 --> 00:16:17,630
Hu Wenzhuo,

243
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,280
you've become far too arrogant.

244
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,670
Your good days are over.

245
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:25,680
According to the patriarch's wishes,

246
00:16:26,630 --> 00:16:27,830
you are to be confined

247
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,320
in Wuzhu Courtyard as punishment.

248
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:31,550
Servants!

249
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,320
No need.

250
00:16:38,270 --> 00:16:39,910
I can walk there myself.

251
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:54,320
Qingyuan.

252
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,390
At the mourning hall,

253
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:02,240
we were all trying to
stop Zhengjun from reading that letter.

254
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,480
But you seemed to be
egging him on the whole time.

255
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:11,000
Were you deliberately
trying to expose the scandal?

256
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,880
I don't understand.

257
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,790
I don't understand

258
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:16,790
what you were trying to accomplish.

259
00:17:23,030 --> 00:17:23,880
Father,

260
00:17:24,550 --> 00:17:25,349
I

261
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:28,319
didn't want to
bring shame upon the family.

262
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:29,790
It's just that...

263
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,720
It's just that I

264
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:37,630
can't bear
that Eldest Brother died unjustly.

265
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:40,000
He was a loyal subject
who protected the people

266
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,920
and brought honor to the Xie family.

267
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:42,980
Most importantly,

268
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:45,720
he was just like you back then, Father.

269
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:48,720
He ventured into
the Northern Frontier alone

270
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,960
and made a name for the family
throughout the realm.

271
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:53,220
But he was harmed by treacherous people.

272
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,510
No matter what it takes,

273
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:56,200
I must seek justice for him.

274
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:58,510
Seek justice?

275
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,370
After the things with Mei Yinghua,

276
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:04,350
I warned you again and again

277
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:05,550
not to cause trouble!

278
00:18:06,270 --> 00:18:07,240
Today,

279
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,770
no matter what excuse you come up with,

280
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:13,600
you intentionally stirred up trouble
in front of everyone.

281
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:17,060
You must be punished
according to family rules.

282
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,550
Yuejian,

283
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,320
fetch the discipline ruler.

284
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:22,740
Yes, Old Madam.

285
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,580
I've just ascended the throne

286
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:49,070
and indeed need to root out some of
the late Empero's corrupt officials.

287
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:50,530
You want to use this matter

288
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:52,880
to get me to approve
your return for revenge, huh?

289
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:53,810
I wouldn't dare.

290
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,480
This is merely what I, Shen Run,

291
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,680
can do for Your Majesty on this journey.

292
00:18:58,680 --> 00:18:59,750
And if you fail?

293
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,640
I'll submit to
whatever punishment Your Majesty decides.

294
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,240
Very well.

295
00:19:04,110 --> 00:19:05,750
Since you have the desire
to avenge your father

296
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:07,480
and the resolve to ease my burdens,

297
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,810
I shall grant your wish.

298
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:10,490
But there is one more thing.

299
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:11,880
When you return this time,

300
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,480
you are bound to spill blood.

301
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,480
But there is one person
you can't lay a hand on.

302
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:18,060
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

303
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,980
And you must also keep him safe for me.

304
00:19:18,310 --> 00:19:19,270
Who is it?

305
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,720
Xie Shu.

306
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:24,800
Your Majesty,

307
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:27,000
his crimes are beyond measure.

308
00:19:27,070 --> 00:19:29,590
-All of this is because...
-Keep Xie Shu safe.

309
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,320
I want you to join hands with him

310
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:33,350
and bring down the person behind him.

311
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,480
This is my condition

312
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:36,750
for allowing you to go back for revenge.

313
00:19:38,350 --> 00:19:39,000
Feng En.

314
00:19:45,830 --> 00:19:47,290
This matter is top secret.

315
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:49,790
No one else may know of it.

316
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:53,550
My Lord,

317
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:57,370
do not forget
His Majesty's instructions to you.

318
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:59,160
I don't want to sound harsh,

319
00:19:59,750 --> 00:20:01,750
but His Majesty's will is absolute.

320
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:04,310
This matter cannot be leaked
in the slightest.

321
00:20:04,310 --> 00:20:05,920
Whoever you intend to meet,

322
00:20:06,270 --> 00:20:08,330
I'll remain outside and stand guard.

323
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,750
Please, My Lord,

324
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,200
do not make things difficult for me.

325
00:20:27,270 --> 00:20:28,030
Mother,

326
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:30,560
these are the dried persimmons

327
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:33,950
my eldest brother loved most
when he was alive.

328
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:36,480
Bring them over, then.

329
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:46,270
Sit.

330
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:06,790
So sweet.

331
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:14,010
You thought I wouldn't dare
eat them, right?

332
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,680
Are you expecting me
to be like Mei Yinghua,

333
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:33,310
terrified of
some so-called karmic retribution

334
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:34,640
and driven mad by fear?

335
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:40,240
I saw through you long ago.

336
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:44,660
You've schemed your way
back into the family

337
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:47,530
just to seek justice
for your mother, right?

338
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:52,310
If

339
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,720
these petty tricks are all you have,

340
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:56,960
I advise you

341
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,160
to give up.

342
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,640
You won't be driven mad,

343
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,780
nor will you regret what you've done.

344
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:10,130
You hid your hand
far better than Mei Yinghua did—

345
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,880
and you're even more ruthless
than she was.

346
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:16,000
For your own petty interests,

347
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:20,550
you dared to move against an official
with illustrious military merit.

348
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:22,160
So why would you possibly fear

349
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,620
mere karmic retribution?

350
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:33,200
What are you here for today?

351
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:38,160
If you've come to flaunt your triumph,

352
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:40,160
then you're too early.

353
00:22:41,030 --> 00:22:42,440
It won't be long

354
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:45,920
before I step out of this Wuzhu Courtyard.

355
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:48,400
The blood debt you owe

356
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:52,440
for my eldest brother's death
will be settled sooner or later.

357
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,550
I'm not in a hurry.

358
00:22:56,310 --> 00:22:57,310
I came today

359
00:22:57,880 --> 00:23:00,340
because there's something
I want to ask you.

360
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,310
Nine years ago,

361
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,720
a few days before my mother died,

362
00:23:04,830 --> 00:23:06,030
you came to our house.

363
00:23:06,830 --> 00:23:08,890
What exactly did you say to my mother?

364
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:16,030
You know about that?

365
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:18,790
I recognized the hairpin you wore that day

366
00:23:18,790 --> 00:23:20,270
the moment I saw it.

367
00:23:20,590 --> 00:23:21,990
There's no mistaking it.

368
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:40,350
You think that just because I saw her,
I'm the murderer?

369
00:23:44,110 --> 00:23:45,110
How naive.

370
00:23:48,830 --> 00:23:49,880
What a pity.

371
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:53,520
You've got the wrong person.

372
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:57,540
The one who harmed your mother

373
00:23:58,070 --> 00:23:59,470
was neither Second Madam

374
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:01,510
nor me.

375
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:05,260
Of course I know who the real murderer is.

376
00:24:14,790 --> 00:24:16,310
Is knowing who it is

377
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:18,000
enough?

378
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,750
You think all of this

379
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:30,020
is connected to Fifth Madam's death?

380
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:32,800
Then you're being far too naive.

381
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:35,960
Back then, your father loved
your mother so deeply

382
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:39,790
that even if she'd committed
some unforgivable offense,

383
00:24:39,790 --> 00:24:40,960
he would never

384
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:43,680
have had the heart to lay a finger on her.

385
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,480
So why

386
00:24:46,590 --> 00:24:48,110
would he agree to let your mother

387
00:24:48,110 --> 00:24:50,110
leave the residence of her own accord,

388
00:24:50,110 --> 00:24:52,000
then not look for her for 9 years,

389
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:54,350
only to kill her as soon as he found her?

390
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:01,570
Everything that happened to your mother,

391
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:03,030
including her death,

392
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:07,200
was because

393
00:25:09,110 --> 00:25:12,240
Xie Shu has a secret
he could never reveal.

394
00:25:13,510 --> 00:25:14,310
What secret?

395
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:26,920
A secret that could shake the heavens.

396
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,720
I might as well...

397
00:25:40,510 --> 00:25:41,790
tell you directly.

398
00:25:46,110 --> 00:25:47,070
That secret

399
00:25:48,510 --> 00:25:50,840
is hidden on your mother's bronze mirror.

400
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:52,690
As for whether you can find it,

401
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:55,340
that depends on your ability.

402
00:25:59,510 --> 00:26:00,270
However,

403
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,750
you'd better hurry.

404
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:07,200
Once I walk out of this Wuzhu Courtyard,

405
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,700
who knows who'll be the one

406
00:26:11,270 --> 00:26:13,070
placed under house arrest next?

407
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:26,480
My Lord, the letter
you wrote to His Majesty

408
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:28,010
was brilliantly composed.

409
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:30,110
First, you grieved over

410
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:32,640
your eldest son's death
in service to the country—

411
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:34,880
weeping your way into
the title of Earl of Zhongyong.

412
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,480
Then you exposed
some corrupt officials here,

413
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:40,250
all the while
clearing yourself of any blame.

414
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:44,310
I don't understand what you're saying,
my dear nephew.

415
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:47,750
I was merely expressing, as a father,

416
00:26:48,510 --> 00:26:52,160
my grief over losing a son.

417
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:01,880
My Lord only named a few small fry

418
00:27:02,790 --> 00:27:04,310
and didn't mention a word

419
00:27:04,510 --> 00:27:06,000
about the man backing you.

420
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:08,880
What man backing me?

421
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:13,400
My dear nephew, you've been
on a killing spree in Hengtang lately,

422
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:16,000
searching high and low
to uncover corruption.

423
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:18,200
There's nothing you can't dig up.

424
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:21,680
I found him.

425
00:27:23,070 --> 00:27:24,530
Isn't he right behind you?

426
00:27:25,270 --> 00:27:28,270
That's why His Majesty has chosen to
elevate your rank

427
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:30,010
and ordered me to protect you.

428
00:27:30,270 --> 00:27:32,670
Isn't it just to uproot
the man backing you?

429
00:27:34,310 --> 00:27:35,510
You found the person?

430
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,960
Who is this person?

431
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:38,280
Tell me quickly.

432
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:43,590
You think

433
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:46,810
not saying his name will keep you safe?

434
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:50,310
If the man behind you learns

435
00:27:51,590 --> 00:27:54,790
that His Majesty intends to
support you in replacing him,

436
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:56,390
do you think he'll let you go?

437
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:07,880
Ever since you rose to high office,

438
00:28:08,310 --> 00:28:11,680
your words have grown
increasingly cryptic.

439
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:14,590
I don't quite understand.

440
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,270
But in any case,

441
00:28:17,310 --> 00:28:18,160
I know—

442
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:21,830
you would never let that man find out,

443
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:23,110
right?

444
00:28:24,030 --> 00:28:26,350
The only thing I know

445
00:28:26,350 --> 00:28:28,030
is that you're here this time

446
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:32,110
under the Emperor's order to keep me safe.

447
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:33,720
Well...

448
00:28:37,830 --> 00:28:39,960
What is there to protect me from?

449
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:42,770
Yet you've been
put to the trouble of doing it.

450
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,270
Don't worry.

451
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:45,880
Unless something serious happens,

452
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:48,550
I won't trouble you.

453
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:55,270
Lord Xie, you're right.

454
00:28:56,310 --> 00:28:58,590
An imperial decree may
protect you for a while,

455
00:28:58,590 --> 00:29:00,240
but not for a lifetime.

456
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:03,350
You think that
with the title of Earl of Zhongyong

457
00:29:03,350 --> 00:29:04,640
and my protection,

458
00:29:05,070 --> 00:29:06,870
you'll be safe from everything?

459
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,350
Lord Xie,

460
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,590
we shall see.

461
00:29:15,240 --> 00:29:16,070
So noisy!

462
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:25,070
The Hu family will
find out sooner or later

463
00:29:25,070 --> 00:29:27,310
that we've placed
Hu Wenzhuo under house arrest.

464
00:29:27,310 --> 00:29:29,350
The situation is currently unclear.

465
00:29:29,350 --> 00:29:30,920
If we fall out,

466
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:33,000
both sides will suffer.

467
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:40,480
We need to let the Hu family

468
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:43,440
see our sincerity

469
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:46,800
and think
that our loyalty remains unchanged.

470
00:29:47,270 --> 00:29:48,800
Since Qinghe's engagement

471
00:29:49,070 --> 00:29:51,070
has already been broken off anyway,

472
00:29:51,750 --> 00:29:53,680
why not send her birth details

473
00:29:54,590 --> 00:29:56,510
to the Hu family?

474
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,240
You mean

475
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:05,200
marry Qinghe into the Hu family
to continue the alliance?

476
00:30:05,750 --> 00:30:08,510
Qingyuan and Shen Run
are devoted to each other,

477
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:11,350
so let them remain entangled.

478
00:30:11,790 --> 00:30:13,720
Qinghe will

479
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,400
marry into the Hu family,

480
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:17,240
while Qingyuan

481
00:30:17,830 --> 00:30:19,360
keeps Shen Run bound to her.

482
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,640
It's like a game of chess—

483
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:25,200
you're only truly secure when you

484
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,550
have pieces on both sides.

485
00:30:28,590 --> 00:30:29,920
You're wise, Mother.

486
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:38,720
It's getting late.

487
00:30:39,070 --> 00:30:40,550
You should go rest.

488
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:43,000
Yes.

489
00:30:51,500 --> 00:30:59,550
♪ Lazy and flirtatious ♪

490
00:31:00,370 --> 00:31:09,000
♪ Drinking toasts ♪

491
00:31:10,370 --> 00:31:25,240
♪ A furrowed brow betrays her sorrow ♪

492
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,000
Yes.

493
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:17,790
It's time for this inner household
to welcome a new brides.

494
00:31:27,630 --> 00:31:45,460
♪ Why keep your heart
so guarded against me? ♪

495
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:36,350
Chunqing?

496
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:58,720
Yuejian.

497
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:10,440
Master.

498
00:32:17,300 --> 00:32:20,830
[Danyue Pavilion]

499
00:32:21,590 --> 00:32:22,310
I heard

500
00:32:22,880 --> 00:32:24,280
you're going to marry me.

501
00:32:26,830 --> 00:32:29,030
There's one more thing I want to ask you.

502
00:32:29,110 --> 00:32:30,570
Why have you pushed Xie Shu

503
00:32:30,590 --> 00:32:32,160
so hard

504
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:36,180
that he's rushing to marry off
his 2 daughters to climb higher?

505
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:40,530
I was trying to expose
the forces behind him.

506
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:43,220
I never meant to harm your eldest sister.

507
00:32:43,270 --> 00:32:44,070
If you ever

508
00:32:44,270 --> 00:32:45,350
need my help,

509
00:32:45,350 --> 00:32:46,160
just ask.

510
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,400
You once told me

511
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,070
that when you returned,

512
00:32:58,350 --> 00:33:01,270
you would take revenge on those
who framed your father

513
00:33:01,270 --> 00:33:04,730
and on the corrupt officials
who oppressed the common people.

514
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:06,920
That

515
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:08,900
also includes Xie Shu,

516
00:33:09,030 --> 00:33:09,680
right?

517
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:16,920
Yes.

518
00:33:23,550 --> 00:33:25,610
You can move against anyone you want,

519
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,720
but not Xie Shu.

520
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,350
Why?

521
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:41,060
He was just granted a title
because of Zhenglun.

522
00:33:42,070 --> 00:33:45,240
His Majesty personally named Xie Shu
the Earl of Zhongyong.

523
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:46,570
Now is not the right time

524
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:47,850
to move against him.

525
00:33:49,750 --> 00:33:50,510
No.

526
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:54,790
You're lying.

527
00:33:58,160 --> 00:33:59,000
Tell me,

528
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,570
what's the real reason?

529
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,440
I just said it.

530
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:08,670
His Majesty just conferred the title
of Earl of Zhongyong on Xie Shu.

531
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:09,710
If you make a move against him now,

532
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:11,840
you'll be moving against His Majesty.

533
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,710
We will all die.

534
00:34:17,510 --> 00:34:19,969
And if I insist on
moving against him anyway?

535
00:34:22,670 --> 00:34:24,000
Then I will protect him.

536
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:38,420
When I first met you as Yan Rui,

537
00:34:39,630 --> 00:34:42,110
everyone said you were
a big corrupt official.

538
00:34:42,110 --> 00:34:43,170
But no one expected

539
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:46,000
that, in the end, you would be the one

540
00:34:46,550 --> 00:34:49,210
to save countless starving people
in Hengtang.

541
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:51,409
When you asked the Marquis for troops,

542
00:34:51,670 --> 00:34:53,030
you said yourself

543
00:34:53,710 --> 00:34:55,110
that you came to Hengtang

544
00:34:55,590 --> 00:34:56,920
for three things:

545
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:58,880
disaster relief,

546
00:34:59,710 --> 00:35:00,910
bandit suppression,

547
00:35:01,590 --> 00:35:03,250
and corruption eradication.

548
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:07,360
The Yan Rui in my heart

549
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:09,880
was an upright hero

550
00:35:10,230 --> 00:35:11,960
who feared neither power nor authority.

551
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,510
So deep down,

552
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,840
you had long since been

553
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:18,360
the Shen Run I knew back then.

554
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,540
I waited for you all this time.

555
00:35:25,150 --> 00:35:26,680
I waited for you to come back

556
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:28,150
so we could finish

557
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:29,960
what we started.

558
00:35:30,710 --> 00:35:31,770
But what about now?

559
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:35,070
You finally came back,

560
00:35:35,630 --> 00:35:37,960
but you tell me
you want to protect Xie Shu—

561
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:39,750
protect a corrupt official,

562
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:41,230
a murderer.

563
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:43,190
All because

564
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,690
His Majesty ordered you not to,

565
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:46,900
and you got scared?

566
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:53,920
You've truly disappointed me.

567
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:03,260
Whether you're Yan Rui

568
00:36:04,450 --> 00:36:05,620
or Shen Run,

569
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:11,700
since our paths are different...

570
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:17,080
let's part ways here.

571
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:55,450
Fourth Sister,

572
00:36:56,510 --> 00:36:57,670
why does the pastry

573
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,960
taste a bit different today?

574
00:37:03,960 --> 00:37:04,820
Fourth Sister?

575
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,320
What's strange about it?

576
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:13,760
It tastes a bit bitter.

577
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:16,920
This is a Solomon's seal cake.

578
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:17,710
The bitterness comes

579
00:37:17,710 --> 00:37:20,110
from one of the ingredients—
Solomon's seal.

580
00:37:20,110 --> 00:37:21,360
You come from a wealthy family,
Young Master Li,

581
00:37:21,360 --> 00:37:23,030
so you may never have eaten it before.

582
00:37:23,030 --> 00:37:23,960
Solomon's seal

583
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,980
grows all over the mountains.

584
00:37:26,150 --> 00:37:27,920
When I was a child,
drifting from place to place,

585
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:29,480
whenever we didn't have enough to eat,

586
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,960
my mother would go to the mountains

587
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:33,070
to gather it
and make it into cakes for me.

588
00:37:33,070 --> 00:37:34,400
It can not only fill the stomach

589
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:35,860
but also nourish the body.

590
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:40,490
After hearing that story,

591
00:37:40,710 --> 00:37:41,800
I feel this bitterness

592
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,230
has a flavor all its own.

593
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:47,260
Fourth Sister,

594
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:49,840
this seems to be the first time
you've told me

595
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,770
about your past.

596
00:37:59,630 --> 00:38:00,670
Young Master Li,

597
00:38:02,110 --> 00:38:04,310
surely you've heard some of it already.

598
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:09,630
My mother was a concubine.

599
00:38:09,960 --> 00:38:11,280
After being wrongfully accused,

600
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:13,880
she left the Xie family
while pregnant with me.

601
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:16,420
She raised me in a dilapidated house.

602
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:18,320
Life was poor,

603
00:38:19,190 --> 00:38:19,960
but we were content.

604
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:21,070
Charge!

605
00:38:26,510 --> 00:38:27,880
Come on!

606
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:30,840
Charge!

607
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:35,550
When I was 9,

608
00:38:36,670 --> 00:38:38,070
there was heavy snow.

609
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:39,880
I was playing in the alley

610
00:38:40,800 --> 00:38:41,800
and bumped into

611
00:38:42,080 --> 00:38:43,490
a prominent nobleman.

612
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:45,150
That very day,

613
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:47,610
a big fire broke out at our home.

614
00:38:48,150 --> 00:38:49,480
As I climbed a ladder up

615
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:51,550
to the attic room,

616
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:53,190
I saw that nobleman

617
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:56,150
glaring fiercely at my mother.

618
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:57,360
My mother

619
00:38:58,280 --> 00:38:59,840
died in that fire.

620
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:02,320
I often wonder:

621
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:05,260
if I hadn't been
so caught up in play that day,

622
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:06,400
if I hadn't gone

623
00:39:07,070 --> 00:39:09,130
with my friend to buy sweets that day,

624
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,500
would my mother...

625
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,280
still be alive?

626
00:39:17,550 --> 00:39:18,880
That wasn't your fault.

627
00:39:20,360 --> 00:39:21,560
What happened after?

628
00:39:21,880 --> 00:39:24,340
Why didn't you report it
to the authorities?

629
00:39:25,230 --> 00:39:27,030
That person held high status
and great power.

630
00:39:27,030 --> 00:39:29,160
Reporting him would've been useless.

631
00:39:30,760 --> 00:39:32,000
Outrageous.

632
00:39:32,440 --> 00:39:34,070
I'll definitely seek justice

633
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:35,070
for your mother.

634
00:39:39,150 --> 00:39:40,210
Young Master Li...

635
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,320
do you really mean it?

636
00:39:43,320 --> 00:39:44,280
Of course I do.

637
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:48,490
Once you and I are married,

638
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:50,630
you'll be the Young Madam of
the Marquis of Danyang's household.

639
00:39:50,630 --> 00:39:51,440
Your mother

640
00:39:51,810 --> 00:39:53,480
will be considered a relative of the Marquis's family.

641
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:54,810
And since that murderer

642
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:57,360
killed the relative of an official,

643
00:39:57,510 --> 00:39:58,960
he should be beheaded for it.

644
00:39:58,960 --> 00:40:00,630
As the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang,

645
00:40:00,630 --> 00:40:02,030
I can bypass the local government

646
00:40:02,030 --> 00:40:03,360
and petition the throne

647
00:40:03,670 --> 00:40:05,440
directly through the Eight Deliberations.

648
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,170
At that time,

649
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:08,610
I'll make that murderer pay in blood.

650
00:40:14,670 --> 00:40:16,200
Thank you, Young Master Li.

651
00:40:19,030 --> 00:40:20,830
It's just that this marriage...

652
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:24,700
Fourth Sister.

653
00:40:27,630 --> 00:40:28,480
I know.

654
00:40:29,880 --> 00:40:31,740
I, Li Congxin, swear here and now:

655
00:40:32,230 --> 00:40:33,230
in this life,

656
00:40:33,960 --> 00:40:35,550
I will marry only you as my wife

657
00:40:35,550 --> 00:40:37,080
and never take a concubine.

658
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:39,190
I will never let you relive the tragedy

659
00:40:39,190 --> 00:40:41,920
your mother endured amid the intrigues of the inner household.
